  <developer id="org.penguinvr">
    <name>PenguinVR</name>
  </developer>
  <summary>PlayStation 2 emulator in VR</summary>
  <description>
    <p>PenguinScreen2 plays PlayStation 2 games in VR — head-tracked big-screen for every game, per-eye stereo depth and head-driven cameras where profiled. It is built on PCSX2, the free and open-source PlayStation 2 emulator, and ships with per-game VR profiles you can edit or extend, one file per game.</p>
    <p>PlayStation 2 and PS2 are registered trademarks of Sony Interactive Entertainment. This application is not affiliated in any way with Sony Interactive Entertainment.</p>
  </description>
